sequenceDiagram
actor Keeper as "Warehouse Keeper"
participant UI as "Interface: UI"
participant API as "mainController: Controller"
participant Service as "inventoryLockService: Service"
participant DB as "PostgreSQL: Database"
Keeper->>UI: Select damaged/expired quantity
UI->>+API: POST /api/v1/inventory-locks
API->>Service: lockQuantity(batch, quantity, reason)
Service->>DB: Validate available and reserved quantities
alt No reserved conflict
    Service->>DB: Lock quantity from allocation/issue eligibility
    API-->>-UI: Stock blocked
else Reserved quantity affected
    Service->>DB: Set affected order to NeedsHandling
    Service->>DB: Preserve reservation for authorized resolution
    API-->>UI: NeedsHandling resolution required
end

